# held/props/sack_child: the child's grain sack for the Carry posture (PROPS, P2b fix round 2; variant 0): the adult sack
# (held/props/sack) cut down to the child's 21 px, burlap in cloth 3, the neck in the fist. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# Anchored on the child's right shoulder (kin/child/arms/arm_r `shoulder`); it rides behind the head (neck), over the back
# when seen from behind, on the near shoulder facing right and behind the head facing left, as the adult's.
use person
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
body child
role held sack
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

view D key shoulder origin 4 3 layer neck
|..QQQ.
|.QSTRQ
|QSTSRQ
|QSSRRQ
|.QRRQ.

view U key shoulder origin 1 3 layer neck
|..QQQ.
|.QSTRQ
|QSTSRQ
|QSSRRQ
|.QRRQ.

view R key shoulder origin 5 3 layer hairFront
|.QQQQ.
|QSTSRQ
|QTSSRQ
|QSRRRQ
|.QQQQ.

view L key shoulder origin -3 6 layer hairBack
|.QQQQ.
|QSTSRQ
|QTSSRQ
|QSRRRQ
|.QQQQ.
